{"thread":{"threadID":3452,"boardID":205,"topic":"~ Knife Theories ~","time":1458772758,"userID":2147,"username":"Doo Doo","lastPostTime":1458933601,"lastPoster":"Nachtfrische","replies":10,"views":1956,"attachments":0,"isSticky":0,"isClosed":0,"cumulativeLikes":-1},"tags":[{"tagID":792,"name":"knifing"}],"posts":[{"postID":45402,"threadID":3452,"userID":2147,"username":"Doo Doo","subject":"~ Knife Theories ~","time":1458772758,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":-1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1831,"username":"Strupino","time":1458809964,"value":-1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>So anyone have any opinions on different knives that can affect your playstyle or something? I heard from some people that Bayonets help them keep track of the range and Karambits make your range longer xDDD</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><span class=\"missing-media\">[respekt*]</span>  <span class=\"missing-media\">[respekt*]</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":45403,"threadID":3452,"userID":1952,"username":"Senpai","subject":"","time":1458772966,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":-1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1831,"username":"Strupino","time":1458809969,"value":-1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>That´s not true.<br>i think thats  just a mind thing <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😄</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":45404,"threadID":3452,"userID":null,"username":"Kain","subject":"","time":1458778599,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1831,"username":"Strupino","time":1458828307,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>no different</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":45405,"threadID":3452,"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","subject":"","time":1458779697,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":3,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1852,"username":"VinceG","time":1458789028,"value":1},{"userID":1831,"username":"Strupino","time":1458828311,"value":1},{"userID":1998,"username":"aXaX.","time":1458849856,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>As I told you in TeamSpeak earlier today, it&#x27;s placebo and people claming that karambits have longer range is nonsense.<br>What might happen though, is that people good at knifing have expensive knifes / knife skins. They play a lot on knifing servers, increase their skill level simply by playing and then buy a knife because it&#x27;s a worthwhile consideration since their play time is high. So you might see good players having knifes and bad knifers having the default skin.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>However, having a knife does not make you a better player, skins are cosmetic only, this is not PayDay 2 <span class=\"archive-emoji\">🙂</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":45408,"threadID":3452,"userID":2147,"username":"Doo Doo","subject":"","time":1458807192,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":-1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1831,"username":"Strupino","time":1458809976,"value":-1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Fair enough, still going to get a Karambit soon though :&#x27;D.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":45412,"threadID":3452,"userID":54,"username":"Craxto","subject":"","time":1458819691,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":-1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1831,"username":"Strupino","time":1458827933,"value":-1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>i was better with my gut knife then with my karambit <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😄</span> but i also was good with my butterfly :3</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":45413,"threadID":3452,"userID":2147,"username":"Doo Doo","subject":"","time":1458826088,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":-1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1831,"username":"Strupino","time":1458827936,"value":-1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Hmmm I already have a butterfly but I REALLLYYYY want a karambit xD gut knifes... idk</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":45442,"threadID":3452,"userID":1998,"username":"aXaX.","subject":"","time":1458924996,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":-1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1831,"username":"Strupino","time":1458934859,"value":-1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>The differents knife&#x27;s give u a different look on ur gamestyle true, but its just in u mind. its the movement that make ur knife. The Karambit is a good knife for make a good movement because u follow the movement from ur knife.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":45446,"threadID":3452,"userID":1903,"username":"dopi","subject":"","time":1458929407,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":2,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","time":1458933453,"value":1},{"userID":1791,"username":"Pixel","time":1458943715,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>the amount of people spelling the plural of knife wrong is too damn high!</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":45447,"threadID":3452,"userID":2147,"username":"Doo Doo","subject":"","time":1458933205,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":-1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1831,"username":"Strupino","time":1458934863,"value":-1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>@aXaX yeah, the karabit swings at the enemy rather than just slashing them which kinda makes it easier to judge the max range as you focus on the crescent of the strike <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😄</span></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>xD is it knifes or knives? Its knives right? :&#x27;D</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":45449,"threadID":3452,"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","subject":"","time":1458933601,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":2,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1831,"username":"Strupino","time":1458934867,"value":1},{"userID":1903,"username":"dopi","time":1458937430,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p><a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1903-der-l/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Der_L.</a> is correct, it is &quot;knives&quot;. The word &quot;knifes&quot; is the 3rd person singular of the verb (to) knife.<br>But I got it wrong myself <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😄</span></p>","polls":[]}]}